[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Quick Work]
[00:12.47]How long had the police taken to find his bicycle?
[00:19.13]Dan Robinson has been worried all week.
[00:23.86]Last Tuesday he received a letter from the local police.
[00:28.87]In the letter he was asked to call at the station.
[00:33.57]Dan wondered why he was wanted by the police, but he went to the station yesterday and now he is not worried anymore.
[00:44.80]At the station, he was told by a smiling policeman that his bicycle had been found.
[00:53.18]Five days ago, the policeman told him, the bicycle was picked up in a small village four hundred miles away.
[01:02.78]It is now being sent to his home by train.
[01:08.21]Dan was most surprised when he heard the news.
[01:12.41]He was amused too, because he never expected the bicycle to be found.
[01:19.84]It was stolen twenty years ago when Dan was a boy of fifteen!
